  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_01",
      "hash": "8107bdd0a1e3bea9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊啊！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是冠、冠軍！？\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳居然來跟我說話，\\n我、我實在是太高興了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_02",
      "hash": "8107bad0a1e3b990",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我、我是一間石頭店的店主，\\n店裡面有賣一些珍貴的石頭……\\c\\n要是冠、冠軍[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想要的話，\\n我可以把我在外國得到的超級石頭\\r\\n盡量便宜賣給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳……"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_01",
      "hash": "f24dce3d0034442f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大針蜂進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_02",
      "hash": "f24dcf3d003445e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大比鳥進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_03",
      "hash": "f24dd03d00344795",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "胡地進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_04",
      "hash": "f24dc93d00343bb0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆殼獸進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_05",
      "hash": "f24dca3d00343d63",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "耿鬼進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_06",
      "hash": "f24dcb3d00343f16",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "袋獸進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_07",
      "hash": "f24dcc3d003440c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "凱羅斯進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_08",
      "hash": "f24dd53d00345014",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "暴鯉龍進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_09",
      "hash": "f24dd63d003451c7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "化石翼龍進化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_10",
      "hash": "f251533d00375c05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "取消"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_03",
      "hash": "8107bbd0a1e3bb43",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓大針蜂進行超級進化的大針蜂進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_04",
      "hash": "8107c0d0a1e3c3c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓大比鳥進行超級進化的大比鳥進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_05",
      "hash": "8107c1d0a1e3c575",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓胡地進行超級進化的胡地進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_06",
      "hash": "8107bed0a1e3c05c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓呆殼獸進行超級進化的呆殼獸進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_07",
      "hash": "8107bfd0a1e3c20f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓耿鬼進行超級進化的耿鬼進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_08",
      "hash": "8107c4d0a1e3ca8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓袋獸進行超級進化的袋獸進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_09",
      "hash": "8107c5d0a1e3cc41",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓凱羅斯進行超級進化的凱羅斯進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_10",
      "hash": "810ac2d0a1e5fcff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓暴鯉龍進行超級進化的暴鯉龍進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_11",
      "hash": "810ac1d0a1e5fb4c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓化石翼龍進行超級進化的化石翼龍進化石\\n₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_11",
      "hash": "f251523d00375a52",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我要買"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_12",
      "hash": "f251513d0037589f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還是算了"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_12",
      "hash": "810ac4d0a1e60065",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝、謝謝惠顧……\\n還有其他需要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_13",
      "hash": "810ac3d0a1e5feb2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "歡、歡迎下次再來……"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_14",
      "hash": "810abed0a1e5f633",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳、[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的錢好像不太夠……"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_15",
      "hash": "810abdd0a1e5f480",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "竟、竟然把所有石頭都買了……\\c\\n真不愧是冠軍……\\n請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好好運用這些超級石頭……"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_16",
      "hash": "810ac0d0a1e5f999",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊、冠、冠軍……\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有好好地在運用超級石頭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_13",
      "hash": "f251503d003756ec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "超級石商店"
    }
  ],
